### Station reports — log in, paste the token below
POST https://localhost:7165/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "superadmin", "password": "<your password>" }

###
@token = <paste token>

GET https://localhost:7165/api/reports/station1?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

