### Health Reports, Station 1 -- an admin's or physician's token; a patient's gets 403
GET https://localhost:7165/api/health-reports/station1?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET https://localhost:7165/api/health-reports/station1?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&office=PROVINCIAL%20HEALTH%20OFFICE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET https://localhost:7165/api/health-reports/station1?from=2026-12-31&to=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health Reports, Station 2 -- patients and the lowest aspect score should match /api/reports/station2's patients and focusArea
GET https://localhost:7165/api/health-reports/station2?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health Reports, Station 3 -- consultations and patients should match /api/reports/station3's completed and patients
GET https://localhost:7165/api/health-reports/station3?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health Reports, Station 4 -- patients and hygiene should match /api/reports/station4's patients and hygiene
GET https://localhost:7165/api/health-reports/station4?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health Reports, Station 5 -- patients and the blurred / near / distant / eyePain yes counts should match /api/reports/station5
GET https://localhost:7165/api/health-reports/station5?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
